## 02 NVIDIA RTX vs. Apple Silicon

### RTX 4070 Super

| Metric | Result |
| :-- | :-- |
| Model | Qwen3.8-27B EXL3 |
| Quantization | 2.00 bpw |
| Generation | **37.21 tok/s avg.** |
| Memory | 11.3–11.5 GiB VRAM |
| Context | 8,192 tokens |
| KV cache | Q4 |
| Benchmark | 5 runs · 942 output tokens avg. · 25.43 s avg. |

### M4 · 32 GB

| Quantization | Generation | Memory | Context | Benchmark |
| :-- | :-- | :-- | :-- | :-- |
| 3-bit | **7.55 tok/s** | ~12.4 GB peak physical footprint | 262,144 max | 1,000 output tokens · 132.5 s |
| 4-bit | **6.17 tok/s avg.** | 14.33 GB model | 262,144 max | 3 runs · 1,000 output tokens · 162.59 s avg. |

